---
import {site} from '../config/site.mjs';
const isDemo=site.mode==='demo';
---
<section class="cinema" aria-labelledby="cinema-heading">
  <div class="cinema-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cinema-aura cinema-aura-one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cinema-aura cinema-aura-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container cinema-main">
    <div class="cinema-content">
      <p class="cinema-overline"><span class="signal"></span> EZERWRIGHT / DIGITAL EXPERIENCES</p>
      <h1 id="cinema-heading">Your business deserves a website that <em>feels ahead.</em></h1>
      <p class="cinema-lead">Distinctive design. Thoughtful interactions. A clear next step for your customers. Built for real service businesses—not another forgettable template.</p>
      <div class="cinema-actions">
        <a class="cinema-primary" href="#cinema-work">Explore the experiences <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="cinema-secondary" href="/contact/">Start a project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="cinema-offer"><strong>US$500</strong> for a defined five-page website <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> $250 to start after written approval <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Client-owned files</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cinema-stage" role="img" aria-label="Original animated concept: layers of a traditional website unfold into a refined service-business website with enquiry actions.">
      <div class="stage-ring ring-one"></div><div class="stage-ring ring-two"></div>
      <div class="stage-glow"></div>
      <div class="website-layer layer-back">
        <div class="layer-top"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>BEFORE / STRUCTURE</b></div>
        <div class="wireframe-lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="wireframe-cols"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="website-layer layer-mid">
        <div class="layer-tag">02 / INTERACTION</div>
        <div class="interaction-ring"><span>+</span></div>
        <div class="layer-progress"><span></span></div>
        <p>From browsing<br/>to an enquiry.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="website-layer layer-front">
        <div class="front-top"><span class="front-brand">FIELDNOTES <i>—</i></span><span class="front-nav">SERVICES&nbsp;&nbsp; WORK&nbsp;&nbsp; CONTACT</span></div>
        <div class="front-image"><span class="image-horizon"></span><div class="front-arc arc-one"></div><div class="front-arc arc-two"></div><div class="front-sun"></div><span class="front-image-note">A BETTER FIRST IMPRESSION</span></div>
        <div class="front-copy"><span class="front-kicker">CONCEPT / SERVICE BUSINESS</span><strong>Make every first impression count.</strong><span class="front-cta">Request an estimate <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="float-note note-one"><span class="float-dot"></span> Motion with meaning</div>
      <div class="float-note note-two">01 — 03 <span>✧</span></div>
      <span class="stage-caption">CONCEPT VISUALIZATION / NO CLIENT WORK SHOWN</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container cinema-bottom"><span>DESIGN THAT EARNS ATTENTION</span><span>BUILT FOR CLARITY, NOT JUST THE SCREENSHOT</span><a href="#cinema-work">SCROLL TO EXPLORE <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
</section>
<section class="cinema-work" id="cinema-work" aria-labelledby="cinema-work-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="work-intro"><div><p class="work-kicker">01 / WHAT'S POSSIBLE</p><h2 id="cinema-work-heading">Not another template.<br/><em>A distinctive experience.</em></h2></div><p>Explore three fictional, interactive website directions. Each shows how a service business could guide visitors from discovery to enquiry. These are agency-made concepts, not commissioned client projects.</p></div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      <a href="/showcase/exterior/" class="work-card exterior">
        <span class="work-top"><b>01 / RINSE & RISE</b><span>EXPLORE ↗</span></span>
        <div class="work-art wash-art"><div class="wash-disc"></div><div class="wash-line one"></div><div class="wash-line two"></div><span>PURE<br/>IMPACT<span class="work-dot">.</span></span></div>
        <span class="work-bottom"><strong>Exterior cleaning</strong><small>Confident, kinetic and conversion-led</small></span>
        <span class="concept-note">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/showcase/pool/" class="work-card pool">
        <span class="work-top"><b>02 / BLUE HOUR</b><span>EXPLORE ↗</span></span>
        <div class="work-art pool-art"><div class="pool-circle one"></div><div class="pool-circle two"></div><div class="pool-circle three"></div><span>BEYOND<br/>THE BLUE.</span></div>
        <span class="work-bottom"><strong>Pool care</strong><small>Calm, luminous and beautifully considered</small></span>
        <span class="concept-note">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/showcase/landscape/" class="work-card landscape">
        <span class="work-top"><b>03 / STONE & STREAM</b><span>EXPLORE ↗</span></span>
        <div class="work-art landscape-art"><div class="landform a"></div><div class="landform b"></div><div class="landform c"></div><span>GROUND<br/>WORK.</span></div>
        <span class="work-bottom"><strong>Landscaping</strong><small>Editorial, grounded and distinctive</small></span>
        <span class="concept-note">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="work-end"><span>Built as concept experiences. No borrowed testimonials, client claims or fabricated results.</span><a href="/services/">View the complete $500 website scope <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="cinema-closing" aria-labelledby="cinema-closing-heading">
  <div class="container closing-inner">
    <p class="work-kicker">02 / FROM IDEA TO OWNERSHIP</p>
    <h2 id="cinema-closing-heading">A striking first impression.<br/><em>A practical business website.</em></h2>
    <p>Five marketing pages, a real enquiry route, responsive layouts, basic on-page SEO, two consolidated revision rounds and portable source. No mandatory hosting contract and no promises of guaranteed sales.</p>
    <div class="closing-steps"><span>01 <b>Define</b></span><span>02 <b>Build</b></span><span>03 <b>Review</b></span><span>04 <b>Hand over</b></span></div>
    <a href="/contact/?service=website" class="cinema-primary">Discuss your website <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <p class="closing-small">US$250 after approved scope · US$250 after accepted staging · Optional future work quoted separately</p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.cinema{--cyan:#96f1db;position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;background:#080f1c;color:#f0f6ff;min-height:740px;padding:0 0 22px}
.cinema *{box-sizing:border-box}.cinema-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.28;background-image:linear-gradient(#5a7f9730 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#5a7f9730 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:74px 74px;mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#000,transparent 84%)}.cinema-aura{pointer-events:none;position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(15px);z-index:-1}.cinema-aura-one{width:700px;height:630px;right:-220px;top:-300px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#115d7169,transparent 68%)}.cinema-aura-two{width:650px;height:520px;left:-370px;bottom:-250px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#1c3ca750,transparent 70%)}
.cinema-main{min-height:660px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.04fr;align-items:center;gap:24px;position:relative;padding-block:70px 56px}.cinema-content{position:relative;z-index:3}.cinema-overline,.work-kicker{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;font-weight:800;color:#7de5c9;margin:0 0 27px}.signal{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;background:#85eaca;box-shadow:0 0 14px #8af1c8;border-radius:50%;margin-right:10px}
.cinema h1{font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#f7f9ff;font-size:clamp(3rem,5.25vw,5.35rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.067em;max-width:720px;margin:0 0 28px;font-weight:750}.cinema h1 em{display:block;font-style:normal;background:linear-gradient(115deg,#a8f4dd 4%,#8fbcef 56%,#e2d1ff 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}.cinema-lead{max-width:550px;color:#bdcddd;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 34px}.cinema-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:13px}.cinema-primary,.cinema-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:24px;min-height:52px;border-radius:6px;padding:13px 20px;font-size:14px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.25;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s ease,background .2s ease}.cinema-primary{background:#a9f0d7;color:#10261f}.cinema-secondary{border:1px solid #86a0ba6b;color:#e7f7f8;background:#ffffff08}.cinema-primary:hover,.cinema-secondary:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}.cinema-primary:hover{background:white}.cinema-secondary:hover{background:#ffffff19}.cinema-offer{font-size:12px;color:#aac0d5;line-height:1.8;margin:25px 0 0;max-width:545px}.cinema-offer strong{color:white}.cinema-offer>span{padding-inline:5px;color:#94e8d2}
.cinema-stage{height:540px;position:relative;perspective:1300px;transform-style:preserve-3d;min-width:0}.stage-ring{position:absolute;border:1px solid #78d4d050;border-radius:50%;transform:rotateX(64deg) rotateZ(-25deg);left:9%;top:6%;width:87%;height:80%;pointer-events:none}.ring-two{transform:rotateX(64deg) rotateZ(22deg);opacity:.32}.stage-glow{position:absolute;inset:14% 0 8%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,#116b7b70 4%,transparent 65%);filter:blur(28px)}
.website-layer{position:absolute;left:10%;right:4%;top:16%;height:350px;border-radius:13px;box-shadow:0 32px 80px #000a;transform-style:preserve-3d;overflow:hidden}.layer-back{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3142,#0c1c31);border:1px solid #7eabc977;transform:translate(-52px,-60px) rotateY(-17deg) rotateX(8deg) scale(.89);opacity:.75;animation:layer-back 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate}.layer-top{height:37px;padding:13px;background:#21384f;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff28;display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center}.layer-top i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#8facc5}.layer-top b{margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#a8c9d9}.wireframe-lines{padding:30px 25px 12px;display:grid;gap:13px}.wireframe-lines span{height:9px;background:#83a9c130;border-radius:3px}.wireframe-lines span:first-child{width:60%}.wireframe-lines span:nth-child(2){width:80%}.wireframe-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;padding:18px 25px}.wireframe-cols span{height:100px;border:1px solid #7d9eac4c;border-radius:5px;background:#9bc5de0f}
.layer-mid{left:21%;right:11%;top:23%;height:334px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0c3543,#17445a);border:1px solid #89e7d76e;transform:translate(35px,-13px) rotateY(-13deg) rotateX(5deg) scale(.91);display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:20px 27px;animation:layer-mid 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate-reverse}.layer-tag{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:#baf0e4;font-weight:700}.interaction-ring{width:116px;height:116px;border:1px solid #b2f3e48d;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:30px auto 15px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 30px #6efcce24,0 0 45px #58a7b552}.interaction-ring span{font-size:56px;font-weight:200;color:#bffaea;line-height:1}.layer-progress{height:2px;background:#94d0d43f;margin:4px 0 15px}.layer-progress span{display:block;width:66%;height:100%;background:#b8f4de}.layer-mid p{font-size:21px;color:#daf9f3;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0}
.layer-front{left:21%;right:0;top:19%;height:358px;background:#f2f3eb;transform:translate(62px,47px) rotateY(-12deg) rotateX(3deg);border:1px solid #d4e2dc;animation:layer-front 7s ease-in-out infinite alternate}.front-top{height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 18px;background:#f7f7ed;color:#182e37}.front-brand{font-family:Manrope;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.06em}.front-brand i{color:#5f8876}.front-nav{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:700;color:#45635a}.front-image{height:149px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(165deg,#062c3a 5%,#0e6870 55%,#86b8a4 100%)}.image-horizon{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 10%,#ccf7cc6b,transparent 30%),linear-gradient(175deg,transparent 53%,#0b404e 54%,#143943 62%,transparent 63%)}.front-arc{position:absolute;width:250px;height:250px;border:1px solid #b4fbd390;border-radius:50%;left:22%;top:28%;transform:rotate(-30deg)}.arc-two{width:330px;height:330px;left:6%;top:0;opacity:.5}.front-sun{position:absolute;width:95px;height:95px;border-radius:50%;right:18%;top:13%;background:radial-gradient(circle,#befdd6aa,transparent 65%);filter:blur(9px)}.front-image-note{position:absolute;bottom:15px;left:19px;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#ecfff3}.front-copy{padding:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;column-gap:8px;align-items:end}.front-kicker{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#3e7772;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:7px}.front-copy strong{max-width:225px;font-family:Manrope;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:1.02;color:#1d3035}.front-cta{align-self:end;display:inline-flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;padding:9px 10px;background:#1e493e;color:#fff;font-size:8px;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:3px}.front-cta b{font-size:12px}
.float-note{position:absolute;z-index:5;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid #b0e9e060;border-radius:5px;padding:10px 13px;color:#e2fff7;background:#0c2635ed;box-shadow:0 20px 35px #0005}.note-one{left:2%;bottom:18%;transform:rotate(-4deg)}.note-two{right:-5%;top:10%;transform:rotate(5deg)}.float-dot{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;background:#a1ffde;border-radius:50%;margin-right:8px}.note-two span{color:#a1ffde;margin-left:10px}.stage-caption{position:absolute;bottom:0;right:0;font-size:9px;color:#7396a7;letter-spacing:.12em}.cinema-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;border-top:1px solid #7099ac32;padding-top:20px;color:#91aaba;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:700}.cinema-bottom a{color:#b6eedd;text-decoration:none}.cinema-bottom a span{font-size:14px}
@keyframes layer-front{from{transform:translate(57px,54px) rotateY(-12deg) rotateX(3deg)}to{transform:translate(70px,35px) rotateY(-9deg) rotateX(2deg)}}@keyframes layer-mid{from{transform:translate(35px,-13px) rotateY(-13deg) rotateX(5deg)}to{transform:translate(24px,-21px) rotateY(-18deg) rotateX(6deg)}}@keyframes layer-back{from{transform:translate(-52px,-60px) rotateY(-17deg) rotateX(8deg) scale(.89)}to{transform:translate(-59px,-44px) rotateY(-20deg) rotateX(8deg) scale(.89)}}
.cinema-work{background:#f5f5ee;padding:110px 0 90px;color:#18322e}.work-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .62fr;gap:40px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:40px}.work-intro h2,.cinema-closing h2{font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.065em;line-height:1.09;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.7vw,4.5rem);color:#19342e;margin:0}.work-intro h2 em,.cinema-closing h2 em{font-weight:500;font-style:italic;font-family:Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.05em;color:#437c71}.work-intro p:last-child{font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#52635e;margin-bottom:0}.work-kicker{color:#4d8179}.work-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.work-card{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;position:relative;min-width:0;background:#fff;padding:13px 13px 18px;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 3px 15px #203b2820;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease}.work-card:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);box-shadow:0 20px 35px #203b2833}.work-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #174f42}.work-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px 7px 14px;gap:8px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800}.work-top span{color:#4d6a62}.work-art{height:310px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:25px}.work-art>span{position:relative;z-index:2;letter-spacing:-.075em;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4.2vw,4.5rem);line-height:.92;font-weight:850}.wash-art{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0c1836 8%,#195b8c 70%,#8ce1dc);color:white}.wash-disc{position:absolute;width:320px;height:320px;right:-130px;top:-85px;border:42px solid #9addf4aa;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 90px #9eedf983;transform:rotateX(38deg)}.wash-line{position:absolute;height:1px;width:420px;left:0;background:#d8fdff8a;transform:rotate(-28deg);top:40%}.wash-line.two{top:57%}.work-dot{color:#aef2de}.pool-art{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#031d2b,#04718e 80%,#38c4b7);color:#e3fbf4}.pool-circle{position:absolute;border:1px solid #a9fafb9e;border-radius:50%;width:330px;height:330px;left:10%;top:28%;box-shadow:inset 0 0 45px #6be6e32c}.pool-circle.two{width:250px;height:250px;left:21%;top:40%}.pool-circle.three{width:170px;height:170px;left:32%;top:52%}.landscape-art{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#e0ddc3,#789276 72%,#244e3b);color:#13362f}.landform{position:absolute;width:430px;height:220px;border-radius:50% 50% 0 0;left:10%;transform:rotate(-16deg);bottom:-120px;background:#426950}.landform.b{bottom:-155px;left:-20%;background:#b2bc86}.landform.c{bottom:-175px;left:30%;background:#264b38}.landscape-art>span{align-self:flex-start;margin-top:26px}.work-bottom{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:18px 7px 0}.work-bottom strong{font-family:Manrope;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.045em;color:#233a36}.work-bottom small{font-size:12px;color:#61736a;margin-top:3px}.concept-note{display:block;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#84918d;padding:12px 7px 0;font-weight:700}.work-end{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-top:30px;font-size:12px;color:#667872}.work-end a{color:#235d50;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.work-end a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.cinema-closing{background:#0b1724;color:#d9eae4;text-align:center;padding:105px 0 110px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.cinema-closing:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%,#126c5c5c,transparent 35%);pointer-events:none}.closing-inner{position:relative}.cinema-closing h2{color:#f6f9ef;max-width:950px;margin:0 auto 25px}.cinema-closing h2 em{color:#a4dfc9}.cinema-closing .work-kicker{color:#8addc2}.cinema-closing .closing-inner>p:not(.work-kicker):not(.closing-small){max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 35px;color:#b2c7c8;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8}.closing-steps{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 auto 38px}.closing-steps span{border:1px solid #648d8547;border-radius:3px;padding:12px 18px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#9cdfc8;font-size:11px}.closing-steps b{color:#fff;margin-left:10px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0}.cinema-closing .cinema-primary{margin:0 auto}.closing-small{color:#91b3ae;font-size:11px;margin:20px auto 0}
@media(max-width:1120px){.cinema-main{grid-template-columns:1fr .9fr;gap:10px}.cinema h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.cinema-stage{transform:scale(.84);transform-origin:40% 50%;margin-right:-70px}.work-art{height:260px}.work-art>span{font-size:3rem}}
@media(max-width:840px){.cinema-main{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-block:85px 25px}.cinema-content{max-width:760px}.cinema h1{max-width:740px}.cinema-stage{margin:0 auto;width:min(600px,100%);transform:scale(.9);transform-origin:center}.cinema-bottom{flex-wrap:wrap}.work-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr}.work-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.work-art{height:280px}}
@media(max-width:580px){.cinema-main{padding-block:64px 20px}.cinema h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,11vw,4rem)}.cinema-lead{font-size:15px}.cinema-actions{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.cinema-primary,.cinema-secondary{width:100%;justify-content:space-between}.cinema-stage{height:380px;transform:scale(.64);transform-origin:0 0;width:155%;margin:15px 0 -115px 0}.cinema-bottom{font-size:8px}.cinema-bottom span:nth-child(2){display:none}.cinema-work{padding:70px 0}.work-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.work-art{height:320px}.work-art>span{font-size:3.4rem}.work-end{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.cinema-closing{padding:75px 0}.closing-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.closing-steps span{padding:12px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.website-layer{animation:none!important}.work-card,.cinema-primary,.cinema-secondary{transition:none!important}.work-card:hover,.cinema-primary:hover,.cinema-secondary:hover{transform:none!important}}
</style>
